flowchart TD
  T[Task arrives at lead] --> R{Checkable result?}
  R -- no: divergent reasoning --> C[Claude does it: lead or Claude subagent]
  R -- yes: lead writes check --> S[mates spawn: worktree + branch + pane]
  S --> W[Qwen worker: edit, run check, loop]
  W --> P[Worker commits, authorship stripped]
  P --> Q[Fresh Qwen verifier: goal + diff + check only]
  Q -- fail --> W
  Q -- pass --> V{Lead reads verdict, reruns check}
  V -- pass --> M[Merge, mates close]
  V -- fail, attempt 1 --> B[Send back with notes]
  B --> W
  V -- fail, attempt 2 --> E[Escalate: Claude takes over]
  C --> L[(log.jsonl)]
  M --> L
  E --> L
